[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20415.43, "timestamp": "05:40:15", "text": "回來了。等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20418.868, "timestamp": "05:40:18", "text": "我真的得吃晚餐了。又一次在平板電腦上吃了頓午餐。等等。讓我趕緊把水添滿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20434.27, "timestamp": "05:40:34", "text": "。一秒鐘。  [音樂] 好的。好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20441.19, "timestamp": "05:40:41", "text": "所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20442.67, "timestamp": "05:40:42", "text": "等等，等等，等等。  呃，我剛才是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20447.31, "timestamp": "05:40:47", "text": "不是不小心把功能關掉了？我的天啊。好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20455.75, "timestamp": "05:40:55", "text": "，我們回來了。  呃，我已經"}]